    {
      "id": 8233898770485,
      "title": "R-Type DX CD Soundtrack Limited Run Games Edition",
      "handle": "r-type-dx-cd-soundtrack-limited-run-games-edition",
      "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\">R-Type DX CD Soundtrack Limited Run Games Edition<br></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">The beginning of a deep space war has arrived on CD!</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">An alien empire from deep space is looking to take over Earth, but humanity has its hopes in its R-Type space fighters.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>From the arcades to portable consoles, the background music of these difficult games would drive players to try again and again.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>Grab your CD player and relive each space battle!</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>PRE-ORDERS CLOSE ON SUNDAY, NOVEMBER 1, 2026 AT 11:59 PM EASTERN TIME.</strong></p>",
