      "id": 8233897197621,
      "title": "R-Type DX Collector's Edition Vinyl Soundtrack",
      "handle": "r-type-dx-collectors-edition-vinyl",
      "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\">R-Type DX Collector's Edition Vinyl<br></p>\n<p>Drop the needle on these retro space tunes!<br></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">The first voyages of the R-9A Arrowhead and R-9C War-Head against the Bydo Empire have been retold across various iterations.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>These groovy tunes blend the original feel of the arcade tracks with the limited low-fi audio channels of the handheld consoles.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">  </span>Get your turntables ready to play 33 music tracks of epic space battles!</p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>PRE-ORDERS CLOSE ON SUNDAY, NOVEMBER 1, 2026 AT 11:59 PM EASTERN TIME.</strong></p>",
